# Breakwater Customs (CIPlay breakwater_customs): the customs house, the entry rules, the radio desk and the watch
# tower's locker (receiver, antenna), the permit desk refusing until the cargo is weighed, the bonded yard, a friend's tip.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Breakwater Customs
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Rumour Is True
zone customs_house
expect step 1
read Authority entry rules
expect step 2
read Councillor Crane's welcome
expect step 3
open Radio desk
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_Reciever 1
expect step 5
open Watch tower locker
wait 3
expect step 7
use permitstamp
expect story permit 0
use weighscale
expect story weighed 1
use permitstamp
expect story permit 1
expect step 8
read Complaint No. 211
expect step 9
zone signal_hill
expect step 10
read Keeper's log
expect step 11
zone wreckers_cave
expect step 12
open Seized boat's hold
wait 3
expect step 13
# STORY 10-24: the bonded yard's maze (no climb-dive-machine template any more)
read Bonded yard notice
expect step 14
zone bw_heart
expect step 15
open Seized goods strongbox
wait 3
expect step 16
read Clerk's last shift
expect step 17
read A friend's tip
expect done
